  "description": "Idempotency integration library for Vali-Mediator (.NET 7/8/9/10).\n            Provides an IIdempotent marker interface, an IIdempotencyStore abstraction,\n            an in-memory implementation with expiry and lazy cleanup, a JSON serializer,\n            and an IdempotencyBehavior pipeline that prevents duplicate request execution.\n            Zero external dependencies beyond Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions\n            and Vali-Mediator.",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
