  "published": "2026-10-01T01:11:28.79Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 — Requires Vali-Mediator >= 3.0.0. IdempotencyScope, payload fingerprint conflicts, bounded in-memory store, Result JSON round-trip. See CHANGELOG.md.\n\n            v1.1.0 — Package structure: now uses Vali-Mediator as NuGet dependency instead of local ProjectReference.\n\n            v1.0.1 — Documentation: enabled XML documentation file for full IntelliSense support.\n\n            v1.0.0 — Initial release:\n            - IIdempotent: per-request idempotency key and optional expiry.\n            - IdempotencyEntry: serialized response envelope with expiry tracking.\n            - IIdempotencySerializer abstraction with System.Text.Json default implementation.\n            - IIdempotencyStore abstraction: FindAsync, StoreAsync, RemoveAsync, ExistsAsync.\n            - InMemoryIdempotencyStore: ConcurrentDictionary-backed with lazy expiry eviction and periodic cleanup sweep.\n            - IdempotencyBehavior: open-generic IPipelineBehavior with per-key SemaphoreSlim locking.\n            - AddIdempotencyBehavior() extension on ValiMediatorConfiguration.\n            - AddInMemoryIdempotencyStore() / AddIdempotencyStore<TStore>() / AddIdempotencySerializer<TSerializer>() on IServiceCollection.",
